    "sentence_translations": [
      "Why Do We Say Buying “East and West”",
      "",
      "East, west, south, and north are the four cardinal directions.",
      "So when Chinese people buy something, why don’t they say buy “south and north”, but rather buy “east and west”?",
      "This is because Chinese people think that “east, west, south, and north” correspond to ”gold, wood, water, and fire” respectively.",
      "",
      "“East and west” correspond to “gold and wood”. “South and north” correspond to “water and fire”.",
      "We can put “gold and wood” in our basket, but we can’t put “water and fire” in our basket.",
      "So we can buy “east and west”, but we can’t buy “south and north”.",
      ""
